# logs/ is the evidence trail for RESULTS.md: keep every text artifact,
# never a binary. Enumerating what to keep is how things get lost.
!logs/**
logs/**/*.sof
logs/**/*.svf
logs/**/*.tgz
logs/**/*.qar
